WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.043
I'll do it!

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.129
Do what, you ask? Have sex!

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.188
It's in bad taste you know?

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:24.607
To watch your own son in action.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.697
Funny that you say that.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:33.241
If you call trembling
with your back turned

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:35.243
while a female makes the move, "Action."

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.747
That's probably a first
since the beginning of life.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.460
I have something to tell you.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:46.504
While you're enjoying your little romance,

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.966
There will be those who don't understand,

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.260
and try to meddle in your affairs.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:56.347
They'll give you advice that means
as much as a fortune cookie,

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.099
when it's none of their business.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.019
Don't listen to a word.

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:07.525
Celibacy doesn't amount to much.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.528
If you want to be strong, do it!

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:13.323
Do it morning, day and night.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.992
Do it before and after meals.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:20.288
Do it until you're tired of it.
Do it until you can't any longer.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:23.041
Just do it until there's nothing left!

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.543
What the hell?

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.046
Kozue, was it?

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:33.635
Be strong in your pride as a woman!

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.555
Let him take you until he tires,

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.474
but still leave him wanting.

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:43.186
Be a woman he can't consume.

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:48.942
I congratulate you both.

